        "original_id": "54608c99-c9b9-5110-a27e-86b55ee2b95a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Louis Zamperini, Spencer Lofranco\n- Films: Unbroken, Dixieland\n- Roles: Harry Brooks\n- Concepts: Olympic distance running, World War II prisoner of war survival, Christian evangelism\n\nFacts:\n- Louis Zamperini was born on January 26, 1917.\n- Louis Zamperini was an Olympic distance runner, a World War II prisoner of war survivor, and a Christian evangelist.\n- The film Unbroken revolves around the life of USA Olympian and army officer Louis Zamperini.\n- In 2014, Spencer Lofranco co-starred as Harry Brooks in the biographical war drama Unbroken.\n- In 2015, Spencer Lofranco played Billy in the crime drama Dixieland.\n- Louis Zamperini died on July 2, 2014.",
